## 代码示例 — HashMap 性能对比

```java
@Test
void hashMapVsTreeMap_performance() {
    int n = 1_000_000;
    var hashMap = new HashMap<Integer, String>();
    var treeMap = new TreeMap<Integer, String>();

    // HashMap 插入
    long start = System.nanoTime();
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        hashMap.put(i, "value" + i);
    }
    long hashInsertTime = System.nanoTime() - start;

    // TreeMap 插入
    start = System.nanoTime();
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        treeMap.put(i, "value" + i);
    }
    long treeInsertTime = System.nanoTime() - start;

    System.out.printf("HashMap insert: %dms%n", hashInsertTime / 1_000_000);
    System.out.printf("TreeMap insert: %dms%n", treeInsertTime / 1_000_000);
    // 预期：HashMap 约 200ms，TreeMap 约 600ms（约 3 倍差距）
}
```

