### 4.4 消息确认

```yaml
spring:
  rabbitmq:
    publisher-confirm-type: correlated   # 发布确认
    publisher-returns: true              # 路由失败返回
    listener:
      simple:
        acknowledge-mode: manual         # 手动确认
        retry:
          enabled: true
