### 2.6 组合模式：正确的装饰顺序

```
组合顺序（从外到内）：
CircuitBreaker → Retry → Bulkhead → TimeLimiter → 业务调用

原因分析：
- CircuitBreaker 在最外层：避免向已熔断的服务重试
- Retry 在 CircuitBreaker 内：重试应在熔断开启时被拦截
- Bulkhead 限制并发：先检查并发容量，再执行调用
- TimeLimiter 最内层：仅限单次调用超时
```

```java
@Service
public class ResilientLlmService {

    private final CircuitBreaker circuitBreaker;
    private final Retry retry;
    private final Bulkhead bulkhead;
    private final TimeLimiter timeLimiter;

    public String callLlmWithFullResilience(String prompt) {
        // 手动组合装饰器
        var decorated = Decorators.ofSupplier(() -> callApi(prompt))
                .withCircuitBreaker(circuitBreaker)
                .withRetry(retry)
                .withBulkhead(bulkhead)
                .withTimeLimiter(timeLimiter, Executors.newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor())
                .withFallback(List.of(
                        CallNotPermittedException.class, e -> "熔断中",
                        RequestNotPermitted.class, e -> "限流中",
                        TimeoutException.class, e -> "超时"
                ))
                .decorate();

        return Try.ofSupplier(decorated)
                .recover(throwable -> "弹性降级响应")
                .get();
    }

    private String callApi(String prompt) {
        return openAiClient.chat(prompt);
    }
}
```

