## 五、删除传播 (Cascade Delete)

### 5.1 同步级联删除

PostgreSQL的`ON DELETE CASCADE`处理数据库层面的级联删除。对于向量索引（pgvector），需要额外处理：

```java
public class CascadeDeleteService {

    private final DataSource dataSource;

    /**
     * 删除文档及其所有切片、Embedding、相关索引
     */
    public void deleteDocument(String documentId) {
        try (var conn = dataSource.getConnection()) {
            conn.setAutoCommit(false);
            try {
                // 1. 删除向量索引（先删子表）
                try (var stmt = conn.prepareStatement(
                    "DELETE FROM chunk_embeddings WHERE chunk_id IN " +
                    "(SELECT chunk_id FROM chunks WHERE document_id = ?::uuid)")) {
                    stmt.setString(1, documentId);
                    stmt.executeUpdate();
                }

                // 2. 删除切片
                try (var stmt = conn.prepareStatement(
                    "DELETE FROM chunks WHERE document_id = ?::uuid")) {
                    stmt.setString(1, documentId);
                    stmt.executeUpdate();
                }

                // 3. 删除文档
                try (var stmt = conn.prepareStatement(
                    "DELETE FROM documents WHERE document_id = ?::uuid")) {
                    stmt.setString(1, documentId);
                    stmt.executeUpdate();
                }

                conn.commit();
            } catch (SQLException e) {
                conn.rollback();
                throw e;
            }
        } catch (SQLException e) {
            throw new RuntimeException(e);
        }
    }
}
```

### 5.2 异步事件驱动删除

在大规模系统中，同步删除可能阻塞。使用Kafka消息异步处理：

```java
import org.springframework.kafka.core.KafkaTemplate;

public class AsyncCascadeDeleteService {

    private final KafkaTemplate<String, String> kafkaTemplate;

    public record DocumentDeleteEvent(String documentId, String tenantId,
                                       java.time.Instant timestamp, String requestId) {}

    public void requestDelete(String documentId, String tenantId) {
        // 1. 标记文档状态为 deleted（软删除，立即可见）
        markAsDeleted(documentId);

        // 2. 发送删除事件
        var event = new DocumentDeleteEvent(
            documentId, tenantId, java.time.Instant.now(), java.util.UUID.randomUUID().toString()
        );
        kafkaTemplate.send("document-delete-events", documentId, toJson(event));
    }

    @org.springframework.kafka.annotation.KafkaListener(topics = "document-delete-events")
    public void handleDeleteEvent(String eventJson) {
        var event = fromJson(eventJson, DocumentDeleteEvent.class);
        // 3. 异步执行级联删除
        // - 删除向量索引（可能很慢）
        // - 删除Elasticsearch索引文档
        // - 删除对象存储中的源文件
        // - 清理缓存
        deleteVectorIndex(event.documentId());
        deleteFromElasticsearch(event.documentId());
        deleteSourceFile(event.documentId());
    }

    private String toJson(Object obj) {
        try {
            return new com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper().writeValueAsString(obj);
        } catch (Exception e) { throw new RuntimeException(e); }
    }

    private <T> T fromJson(String json, Class<T> clazz) {
        try {
            return new com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper().readValue(json, clazz);
        } catch (Exception e) { throw new RuntimeException(e); }
    }

    private void markAsDeleted(String docId) { /* UPDATE documents SET status='deleted' */ }
    private void deleteVectorIndex(String docId) { /* pgvector清理 */ }
    private void deleteFromElasticsearch(String docId) { /* ES文档删除 */ }
    private void deleteSourceFile(String docId) { /* S3/MinIO文件删除 */ }
}
